"""Miami Solutions Group brand assets, embedded.

The mono BLACK mark is the correspondence lockup — the brand guide records that as a final decision.
Red belongs to consumer marketing (door hangers, direct mail cards, Instagram) and must never appear
on a letter. Kept as a base64 data URI, and committed, so headless senders and the nightly cloud cron
render identically to the board without shipping a binary or reaching the network for an image.

Native asset is 238x203 px (aspect 1.1724). Derive width from height so it always scales, never stretches.
"""

MONO_B64 = "data:image/png;base64,"
NATIVE_W, NATIVE_H = 238, 203


def mark_size(height_px):
    """Width for a given height, preserving the native aspect."""
    return round(height_px * NATIVE_W / NATIVE_H)
